      "message": "I wonder if it\u0027s even possible (or \"should\" in the first place) to show one of the verified boot failure screen (https://source.android.com/security/verifiedboot/verified-boot#user_experience).  That\u0027s probably before init, but might be an OK UX.  Feel free to leave a TODO at this point for error recovery UX.  For now, perhaps let\u0027s try to make nftw as robust as we can.",
