      "writtenOn": "2018-01-30T20:25:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that kind of screen would be good, though this is really a decision for the android UX and security teams so I\u0027ll delegate to them. I don\u0027t think that nftw can be made more robust than it already is because of what I mentioned in reply to your previous comment.\n\nRegardless of whether we can make nftw more robust, what do we want to do for now if it ultimately fails for now? I can put a TODO to see if we can get a screen like that, but are we okay just hanging the boot for now?",
